      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunset_District%2C_San_Francisco",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the 1970s punk boom, Sunset District hosted venues like Mabu Studio and the Great American Music Hall.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
